ed by nanomachines, they started attacking humans. Some military robots have larger and tougher armor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/3208356336b21581259628c807e3ac89.poster.avif?t=1749346776\" width=736 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/3208356336b21581259628c807e3ac89.webm?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/3208356336b21581259628c807e3ac89.mp4?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>3 Nanomorph<br>They are new lifeforms created by clusters of nanomachines, exhibiting various unique behaviors such as splitting and camouflage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/90eedd50fedd859b52e050b364c8cc71.poster.avif?t=1749346776\" width=422 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/90eedd50fedd859b52e050b364c8cc71.webm?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/90eedd50fedd859b52e050b364c8cc71.mp4?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources and Mining</h2>Obtain resources by defeating enemies or by dismantling minerals and various debris.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/07ac60f12c9f14020d7893f9cc3c72be.poster.avif?t=1749346776\" width=636 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/07ac60f12c9f14020d7893f9cc3c72be.webm?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/07ac60f12c9f14020d7893f9cc3c72be.mp4?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft various equipment using the resources you have obtained</h2>Craft various equipment and use them to defeat enemies or explore the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/80b1d2168d2285faac191f2e6be972d8.poster.avif?t=1749346776\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/80b1d2168d2285faac191f2e6be972d8.webm?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/80b1d2168d2285faac191f2e6be972d8.mp4?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your base</h2>Build your base to store resources, craft equipment and vehicles, and create a place to rest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/7ea90c6a6eed6fa884165dd4e6a9b6b1.poster.avif?t=1749346776\" width=562 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/7ea90c6a6eed6fa884165dd4e6a9b6b1.webm?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097220/extras/7ea90c6a6eed6fa884165dd4e6a9b6b1.mp4?t=1749346776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
